<title>USA: Seacoast Banking completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Seacoast Banking completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>STUART, Fla. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seacoast Banking Corp of Florida said Friday it has completed its acquisition of the Port St. Lucie National Bank Holding Corp.</p>
<p>It said Port St. Lucie shareholders will receive 900,000 shares of Seacoast common stock. Seacoast stock closed Friday at 26-1/4 on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>Port St. Lucie has about $133 million in assets, and the acquisition brings assets at Seacoast to about $900 million.</p>
</text>
